    "detail": {
      "id": 1350151,
      "name": "[Yidhari] Piercing Light",
      "desc": "When Yidhari performs a 3-stage charged attack with <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Frostbite Embrace</color>, she gains <color=#FFFFFF>Temporary Shield</color> each time she hits an enemy during the spinning horizontal attack. When Yidhari performs the final downward smash of this <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Frostbite Embrace</color> sequence, or when she performs an ALT <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Glacial Crush</color> during the charged attack ALT, all <color=#FFFFFF>Temporary Shield</color> will be consumed to <color=#2BAD00>increase the attack's DMG by up to 240%</color> based on the amount of <color=#FFFFFF>Temporary Shield</color> consumed. The Temporary Shield <color=#2BAD00>caps at 80% of Yidhari's Max HP.</color> All <color=#FFFFFF>Temporary Shield</color> will be reset if the spinning horizontal attack is interrupted.",
